### PHASE 24: PROJECT AND ACCOUNT LIFECYCLE CLEANUP

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@ownerToken = Bearer <OWNER_JWT>
@collabToken = Bearer <COLLABORATOR_JWT>
@socialToken = Bearer <SOCIAL_ONLY_USER_JWT>
@superUserToken = Bearer <SUPERUSER_JWT>

### 1. Soft Delete Project (Closes pending join requests as system_closed & cancels pending invites)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj-101
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}

### 2. Attempt Creating 4th Project After Deleting 3 Within 24h (429 PROJECT_DAILY_LIMIT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Fourth Project Bypass Attempt",
  "description": "Deleted projects created in the last 24 hours still count toward the 3-per-day project creation cap.",
  "teamSize": 4,
  "dueDate": "2027-03-01T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### 3. Request Single-Use 6-Digit Email Verification Code for Passwordless Account Deletion (204 No Content, 1/min limit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/me/delete/request-code
Authorization: {{socialToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 4. Reject Social-Only Deletion Without Email Code or Legacy socialConfirmed Flag (400 REAUTH_REQUIRED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/me/delete
Authorization: {{socialToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "social_user_handle",
  "socialConfirmed": true
}

### 5. Confirm Passwordless Account Deletion With 6-Digit Email Code (Frees Seats, Tasks, CVs & Exports)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/me/delete
Authorization: {{socialToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "social_user_handle",
  "code": "123456"
}

### 6. Confirm Password Account Deletion With Wrong Password (400 INVALID_PASSWORD)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/me/delete
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "collab_username",
  "password": "WrongPassword!"
}

### 7. Trigger Hourly Cron Jobs Tick (Skips Draft/Closed/Completed/Deleted projects via isLiveProject, emits JOB_SKIPPED_NOT_LIVE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/tick
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}

### 8. Inspect Job Runs Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/runs
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}
